{"product":{"id":8191334056188,"title":"POLYGON - Enchanted Forest - Nature Biome","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe class=\"ratio-16-by-9\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/ysQ2F7i1fms\" title=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSynty® Studios\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e presents:  POLYGON -\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eEnchanted Forest - Nature Biome\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeel the mystical embrace of POLYGON - Enchanted Forest - Nature Biome as it draws you into the ethereal.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs you traverse this 3D low poly demo scene, experience air humming with enchantment, where various majestic trees, adorned with gracefully simplified foliage, form a celestial canopy overhead, casting a spell of tranquility upon the moss-covered forest floor. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEvery asset, from the spellbinding environment materials to the gentle wave-like hills, is meticulously crafted to transport your players to a place where magic and nature merge. POLYGON - Enchanted Forest - Nature Biome beckons, inviting you to infuse your digital realms with the enchantment of a truly magical experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNature Biomes Packs: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBundles:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-nature-biomes-season-one\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePOLYGON - Nature Biomes - Season One\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-nature-biomes-season-two\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePOLYGON - Nature Biomes - Season Two\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndividual Asset Packs: \u00